{"unit_id":"FuWenLianggit__dsh-session-link#feature-1","repo":"FuWenLianggit/dsh-session-link","commit":"182b4199bade742cb89726af767d89190e9dfa75","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-link 的功能「复制会话直达链接」：会话标题旁显示链接按钮；点击后将当前站点地址和会话 ID 组合为 ?session= 链接并复制到剪贴板，复制失败时尝试隐藏文本框回退。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:35-59","src/client/index.tsx:69-99"]}
{"unit_id":"FuWenLianggit__dsh-session-link#feature-2","repo":"FuWenLianggit/dsh-session-link","commit":"182b4199bade742cb89726af767d89190e9dfa75","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-link 的功能「通过链接打开会话」：启动时读取 URL 的 session 参数；若参数非空，就调用工作区导航打开该会话，在会话目录尚未加载时按间隔重试，最多尝试 50 次。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:102-138"]}
{"unit_id":"FuWenLianggit__dsh-session-link#feature-3","repo":"FuWenLianggit/dsh-session-link","commit":"182b4199bade742cb89726af767d89190e9dfa75","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-link 的功能「卸载时清理注册与重试」：客户端通过 effect 管理标题按钮注册和会话打开重试；清理时停止待执行重试并释放按钮注册，避免插件卸载后继续导航。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:110-138","src/client/index.tsx:147-152"]}
